# Publish source and documentation through an allowlist.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.md
!requirements*.txt
!.gitignore
!pytest.ini

.git/
.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
build/
*.egg-info/
**/results/
**/results_*/
**/artifacts/
**/cache/
**/checkpoints/

# motif_results also contains required analysis engines: retain their sources.
**/motif_results/*
!**/motif_results/sibling_topology_analysis/
!**/motif_results/sibling_topology_analysis_new/
!**/motif_results/sibling_topology_analysis_ranking_normalized/
!**/motif_results/sibling_topology_topology(only)_analysis/
!**/motif_results/tri7_trace_analysis(all)/

# All study inputs, count matrices, figures, run logs and compiled objects stay local.
